# The models the ComfyUI image loads, and nothing else (ADR-0004 decision 11
# as refined 2026-10-05). One line per file:
#
#   <path under models/>  <source>  <sha256>  <licence>  <checked>
#
# `source` is `hf:<owner>/<repo>/<path in repo>` (resolved at `main`; the hash
# is the pin, not the revision) or `r2:<key>` (the models prefix, first
# filled by our own LoRA at roadmap item 9). `licence` is the weights
# licence as read on `checked` — this line IS the licence record ADR-0004 §1
# requires, so a model with no line here never runs. Never edit a hash to
# make a download pass: a changed file is a changed decision.

# SDXL 1.0 base — CreativeML Open RAIL++-M (LICENSE.md in the repo, dated
# 2023-07-26). Commercial use and derivative outputs permitted; Attachment A's
# use restrictions (unlawful use, harming minors, disinformation, harassment,
# automated decisions about individuals, medical/legal use) touch nothing we
# do. Read 2026-10-07.
checkpoints/sd_xl_base_1.0.safetensors  hf:stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0/sd_xl_base_1.0.safetensors  31e35c80fc4829d14f90153f4c74cd59c90b779f6afe05a74cd6120b893f7e5b  CreativeML-OpenRAIL++-M  2026-10-07

# IP-Adapter Plus for SDXL (ViT-H conditioning) — Apache-2.0, the licence of
# the h94/IP-Adapter repo as a whole (model card, repo revision 018e402).
# Read 2026-10-07.
ipadapter/ip-adapter-plus_sdxl_vit-h.safetensors  hf:h94/IP-Adapter/sdxl_models/ip-adapter-plus_sdxl_vit-h.safetensors  3f5062b8400c94b7159665b21ba5c62acdcd7682262743d7f2aefedef00e6581  Apache-2.0  2026-10-07

# The CLIP image encoder IP-Adapter conditions through: OpenCLIP ViT-H/14
# (laion2B-s32B-b79K; hidden 1280, projection 1024, 224 px), redistributed
# in h94/IP-Adapter under Apache-2.0; LAION's original is MIT. The file name
# is the one ComfyUI's IP-Adapter node documents. Read 2026-10-07.
clip_vision/CLIP-ViT-H-14-laion2B-s32B-b79K.safetensors  hf:h94/IP-Adapter/models/image_encoder/model.safetensors  6ca9667da1ca9e0b0f75e46bb030f7e011f44f86cbfb8d5a36590fcd7507b030  Apache-2.0  2026-10-07

